flowchart TD
    Player([Player])

    subgraph Game["Game (app.py + logic_utils.py)"]
        Guard["Input guardrails<br/>parse_guess + range check"]
        Check["check_guess<br/>hint + Hot/Cold + score"]
        Guard -->|valid guess| Check
    end

    subgraph Clue["Clue chat (ai_coach.py)"]
        Input["Input check<br/>empty or over 200 chars?"]
        Ask["Chat prompt: topic rules,<br/>history and hints, question<br/>in tags (never the secret)"]
        Read{"CHECK reply<br/>valid JSON?"}
        Answer["Answer + Try this number"]
        Refuse["Refusal message<br/>(written by code)"]
        Input -->|ok| Ask --> Read
        Read -->|no: retry once,<br/>then fallback| Ask
        Read -->|on-topic| Answer
        Read -->|off-topic| Refuse
    end

    subgraph Agent["Suggestion agent (tool)"]
        Plan["1. PLAN<br/>numbers still possible"]
        Act["2. ACT<br/>specialized prompt"]
        Verify["3. CHECK<br/>valid JSON and in range?"]
        Fallback["FALLBACK<br/>middle of the range"]
        Plan --> Act --> Verify
        Verify -->|no: retry once| Act
        Verify -->|still failing| Fallback
    end

    Player -->|types a guess| Guard
    Player -->|"opens Clue, types a message<br/>or clicks a quick question"| Input
    Read -->|wants a number to try| Plan
    Answer -->|needs a new number| Plan
    Ask <-->|prompt / JSON| Gemini[["Gemini API"]]
    Act <-->|prompt / JSON| Gemini
    Clue -.->|4. LOG each step| Log[("logs/coach.log")]
    Agent -.-> Log

    Result([Player sees the result])
    Guard -->|invalid: error,<br/>no attempt used| Result
    Check -->|hint| Result
    Input -->|empty or too long:<br/>no AI call| Result
    Answer --> Result
    Refuse --> Result
    Verify -->|"yes: Try this number<br/>(player decides = human-in-the-loop)"| Result
    Fallback -->|Try this number| Result

    subgraph Testing["Testing and evaluation"]
        Pytest["pytest: 27 tests<br/>(AI mocked)"]
        Eval["evaluate.py: 8 cases<br/>real Gemini, specialized vs baseline"]
    end
    Game -.->|checked by| Pytest
    Clue -.->|checked by| Pytest
    Agent -.->|measured by| Eval
